  "title": "Sweet Rhubarb Crisp",
  "description": "This sweet rhubarb crisp recipe is made by sprinkling chopped rhubarb over a buttery oat crumble crust and pouring a hot, thick, sugary syrup on top.",
  "authors": [
    "Karen Schrock"
  ],
